# Koleksi REST — Dashboard
# Salin session.access_token dari respons login (auth.http) ke @token.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_ACCESS_TOKEN_DARI_LOGIN

### ============================================================
### GET /dashboard
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {balance, month, cashflow[], recent_transactions[]} untuk bulan berjalan
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sukses: bulan tertentu
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sukses: bulan tanpa transaksi, semua angka 0, cashflow kosong
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard?month=2020-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 400: format bulan salah
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard?month=September-2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 400: bulan 13
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard?month=2026-13
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 401: tanpa token
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
